# Create an inference key at https://console.thesys.dev/keys.
# Configure THESYS_API_KEY privately in .env.local to enable OpenUI Gateway generation.
# Optional: set OPENUI_MODEL to a supported provider/model identifier.
# Default model: openai/gpt-5.6-terra
# Optional: OPENUI_REASONING_EFFORT sets how long the model reasons before it answers. Default: low.
# Optional: OPENUI_PROVIDER limits the model to OpenRouter provider slugs (comma-separated), with no
# fallback. Example: OPENUI_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b with OPENUI_PROVIDER=cerebras/fp16 runs on Cerebras.
# Optional: DEMO_USER_ID and APP_ID set the Gateway identity for stored threads.
# Defaults: demo-user and booking-assistant-cookbook.
